{"title":"Career roadmap · Media Buyer","role":"Media Buyer","summary":"A Media Buyer plans, purchases, optimizes and evaluates paid advertising inventory across platforms such as search engines, social media, video, display, programmatic networks and other digital or traditional media channels.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM – Event / Media / Film Business"},"about":[{"label":"Primary tools","text":"Google Ads, Meta Ads, analytics platforms, spreadsheets, dashboards and campaign-management tools"},{"label":"Key capabilities","text":"Media planning, audience targeting, bidding, budget allocation, campaign optimisation and performance analysis"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build advertising, media, analytics and campaign-management skills; complete paid-media internships"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Progress from Media Buyer/Paid Media Executive to Senior Media Buyer or Performance Marketing Manager"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Own larger budgets, channels, markets and performance strategy"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Move toward Media Director, Performance Marketing Director, Growth Lead, agency leadership or independent consulting"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a student pursuing BBA – Event / Media / Film Business, Media Buying is a strong and relevant career path, particularly when the student combines media/business knowledge with digital advertising, analytics, audience targeting, campaign measurement and AI-assisted marketing."},{"type":"flow","items":["Media Buying Intern","Media Buyer / Paid Media Executive","Senior Media Buyer","Performance Marketing Manager","Paid Media Lead / Media Director"],"label":"Typical entry routes include"}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong/direct alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"BBA Event/Media/Film Business provides useful exposure to media, communication, entertainment and commercial aspects of the industry. The student should add a strong performance-marketing and analytics layer to become employable as a modern Media Buyer."},{"type":"h","text":"Timeline assumption"},{"type":"p","text":"This roadmap assumes a 4-year UG programme beginning in 2026 and graduating around 2030."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Marketing, communication, Excel and media fundamentals"},{"text":"College + Excel resources"},{"text":"Marketing analysis"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Advertising ecosystem, consumer behaviour and media planning"},{"text":"Marketing cases"},{"text":"Media-plan assignment"},{"text":"Media knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Google Ads, Meta Ads, campaign structures and targeting"},{"text":"Official platform learning"},{"text":"Practice campaigns"},{"text":"Platform skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Analytics, KPIs, conversion tracking and reporting"},{"text":"Analytics resources"},{"text":"Campaign dashboard"},{"text":"Measurement"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Performance marketing, bidding, optimisation and experimentation"},{"text":"Industry projects"},{"text":"Campaign optimisation case"},{"text":"Performance skills"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Paid-media internship + budget management"},{"text":"Agency/in-house internship"},{"text":"Internship portfolio"},{"text":"Professional readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced media planning, attribution, programmatic and AI"},{"text":"Advanced industry resources"},{"text":"Integrated media plan"},{"text":"Strategic capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Portfolio, interviews and job applications"},{"text":"Job descriptions + mock cases"},{"text":"3–5 campaign cases"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Media Buyer skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STP — Segmentation, Targeting, Positioning"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Marketing funnel"},{"text":"Brand positioning"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Marketing mix"},{"text":"Demand generation"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Brand awareness"},{"text":"Performance marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Media Buyer should understand why a campaign exists, not simply how to operate an advertising dashboard."}]},{"heading":"Media planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign objectives"},{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Media mix"},{"text":"Channel selection"},{"text":"Budget allocation"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Flighting"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Geographic targeting"},{"text":"Audience segmentation"},{"text":"Creative formats"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Awareness","Consideration","Conversion","Retention"]}]},{"heading":"Paid advertising platforms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build practical familiarity with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Google Ads"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search campaigns"},{"text":"Display"},{"text":"Video/YouTube"},{"text":"Shopping where relevant"},{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Match types"},{"text":"Bidding"},{"text":"Ad groups"},{"text":"Ad quality"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"Search terms"},{"text":"Negative keywords"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Meta advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign structure"},{"text":"Objectives"},{"text":"Audiences"},{"text":"Custom audiences"},{"text":"Lookalike audiences"},{"text":"Placements"},{"text":"Creative testing"},{"text":"Budget optimisation"},{"text":"Conversion campaigns"},{"text":"Retargeting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Platform interfaces and campaign products change frequently, so students should learn the underlying advertising concepts, not just memorise the current UI."}]},{"heading":"Campaign metrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"table","header":["Metric","Meaning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Number of ad deliveries"}],[{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Number of people/accounts reached"}],[{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Average exposure per reached audience"}],[{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Click-through rate"}],[{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"Cost per click"}],[{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"Cost per thousand impressions"}],[{"text":"CVR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"}],[{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Cost per acquisition"}],[{"text":"CPL"},{"text":"Cost per lead"}],[{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Return on ad spend"}],[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Customer acquisition cost"}],[{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not optimise only for clicks. The correct KPI depends on the business objective and customer journey."}]},{"heading":"Analytics and measurement","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics concepts"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"UTM parameters"},{"text":"Event tracking"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Landing-page analytics"},{"text":"Conversion-rate optimisation"},{"text":"Marketing dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn spreadsheet analysis using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Microsoft Excel for structured campaign analysis.","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"}]},{"heading":"SQL and data analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is increasingly valuable for an advanced Media Buyer or Performance Marketer."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Date functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice through SQLBolt.","url":"https://sqlbolt.com/"},{"type":"p","text":"For larger organisations, learn how advertising data can connect with:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Ad platforms","analytics","CRM","data warehouse","dashboard"]}]},{"heading":"Creative understanding","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Media Buyer does not necessarily need to be a professional graphic designer or filmmaker, but should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative formats"},{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Hooks"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Video structure"},{"text":"Thumbnails"},{"text":"Landing-page alignment"},{"text":"Creative fatigue"},{"text":"Brand consistency"},{"text":"Audience-message fit"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a Media/Film Business student, this can become a major advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"The student can combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Media storytelling","advertising strategy","performance analytics"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"A/B testing and experimentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Visuals"},{"text":"Videos"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Offers"},{"text":"Audiences"},{"text":"Placements"},{"text":"Ad formats"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A proper experiment should define:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hypothesis","Variable","Audience","KPI","Test period","Result","Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid declaring a winner simply because one version received more clicks; statistical and business significance matter."}]},{"heading":"Attribution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First-touch attribution"},{"text":"Last-touch attribution"},{"text":"Multi-touch concepts"},{"text":"Data-driven attribution"},{"text":"Incrementality"},{"text":"Marketing mix modelling"},{"text":"Cross-channel measurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Attribution is imperfect. A good Media Buyer understands the difference between reported attribution and true incremental business impact."}]},{"heading":"Programmatic advertising","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For advanced roles, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DSP"},{"text":"SSP"},{"text":"Ad exchange"},{"text":"Real-time bidding"},{"text":"Programmatic buying"},{"text":"Audience segments"},{"text":"Frequency management"},{"text":"Brand safety"},{"text":"Viewability"},{"text":"Fraud"},{"text":"Contextual targeting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly useful for candidates targeting large agencies and enterprise advertising teams."}]},{"heading":"AI for Media Buying","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, learn how AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Keyword expansion"},{"text":"Creative ideation"},{"text":"Ad-copy generation"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Budget recommendations"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Competitive research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But retain human control over:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Budget decisions"},{"text":"Brand safety"},{"text":"Legal/compliance issues"},{"text":"Targeting logic"},{"text":"Measurement methodology"},{"text":"Experiment design"},{"text":"Business strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future Media Buyer is increasingly an AI-assisted performance marketer, rather than someone who only operates advertising interfaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete media plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical campaign for:"},{"type":"h","text":"A new film / OTT series / music event / conference / consumer product"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Campaign objective"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Channels"},{"text":"Media mix"},{"text":"Campaign timeline"},{"text":"Creative formats"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Expected outcomes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Google Ads case study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated search campaign."},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Campaign structure"},{"text":"Ad groups"},{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Negative keywords"},{"text":"Bidding strategy"},{"text":"Landing page"},{"text":"Conversion goal"},{"text":"Optimisation plan"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Meta campaign analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated campaign and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience"},{"text":"Creative"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Campaign dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI/Excel dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spend"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Clicks"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Microsoft Power BI.","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Film/event marketing campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly relevant to the student's degree."},{"type":"p","text":"Design a campaign for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Film launch / music festival / international conference / entertainment event"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience segments"},{"text":"Geographic targeting"},{"text":"Media budget"},{"text":"Creative formats"},{"text":"Influencer/media partnerships"},{"text":"Paid social"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Video"},{"text":"Retargeting"},{"text":"Conversion funnel"},{"text":"Ticket/registration sales"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours / extended-degree variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the programme provides a fourth-year honours/research option, use the additional year to develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced marketing analytics"},{"text":"Consumer research"},{"text":"Advertising effectiveness"},{"text":"Media economics"},{"text":"Marketing experimentation"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Marketing mix modelling"},{"text":"AI in advertising"},{"text":"Digital consumer behaviour"},{"text":"An applied research project"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong fourth-year project could investigate:"},{"type":"h","text":"“How AI-assisted media buying affects campaign efficiency and creative performance.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Media Buying specialisation lanes"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Paid Social"},{"text":"Meta + TikTok/other social platforms + analytics"},{"text":"Paid Social Lead"}],[{"text":"Paid Search"},{"text":"Google Ads + keyword strategy + analytics"},{"text":"Search/PPC Lead"}],[{"text":"Performance Marketing"},{"text":"Paid media + CRO + analytics"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"Programmatic"},{"text":"DSP + audience + RTB + measurement"},{"text":"Programmatic Lead"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Marketing"},{"text":"Film/media + paid campaigns + audience analytics"},{"text":"Entertainment Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"Event Marketing"},{"text":"Paid media + ticketing + CRM + analytics"},{"text":"Event Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Paid media + product feed + CRO + ROAS"},{"text":"E-commerce Growth Manager"}],[{"text":"Growth Marketing"},{"text":"Acquisition + experimentation + retention"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"Media Planning"},{"text":"Research + media mix + budget allocation"},{"text":"Media Planning Manager"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + BI + attribution + statistics"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Agency Media Buying"},{"text":"Multi-client campaigns + optimisation"},{"text":"Media Director"}],[{"text":"AI Marketing"},{"text":"AI + automation + analytics + paid media"},{"text":"AI/Growth Marketing Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant · 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Media buying is likely to become increasingly automated at the campaign-operations layer. Therefore, long-term career growth should move toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media strategy"},{"text":"Audience strategy"},{"text":"Incrementality"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Creative strategy"},{"text":"Customer economics"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"AI-assisted campaign management"},{"text":"First-party data"},{"text":"Privacy-aware measurement"},{"text":"Omnichannel planning"},{"text":"Business growth"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career should evolve from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can operate an ad platform”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can allocate capital across channels and demonstrate incremental business impact.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That distinction becomes increasingly important at senior levels."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government, public-sector and research exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / route","Possible exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"NITI Aayog","url":"https://www.niti.gov.in/"},{"text":"Communication, digital initiatives and public campaigns"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Information & Broadcasting","url":"https://mib.gov.in/"},{"text":"Media, broadcasting and communication ecosystem"}],[{"text":"Press Information Bureau","url":"https://pib.gov.in/"},{"text":"Public communication and media"}],[{"text":"Atal Innovation Mission","url":"https://aim.gov.in/"},{"text":"Innovation and entrepreneurship communication"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme","url":"https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/"},{"text":"Industry exposure where eligible"}],[{"text":"Universities / research institutes"},{"text":"Marketing, communications and event promotion"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Government internships may not involve direct commercial media buying. They are useful primarily for communication, media planning, campaign coordination and public outreach exposure."},{"type":"h","text":"Private-sector internships"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media Buying Intern"},{"text":"Paid Media Intern"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Media Planning Intern"},{"text":"Advertising Intern"},{"text":"Campaign Operations Intern"},{"text":"Growth Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Advertising Intern"},{"text":"Programmatic Advertising Intern"},{"text":"Entertainment Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Event Marketing Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Target employers across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"Media agencies"},{"text":"Film studios"},{"text":"OTT platforms"},{"text":"Event companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"D2C brands"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Travel companies"},{"text":"Digital publishers"},{"text":"Entertainment companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning route","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"Google Ads certification/learning"},{"text":"Search and digital advertising"}],[{"text":"Meta Blueprint"},{"text":"Meta advertising"}],[{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Measurement"}],[{"text":"NPTEL Marketing / Advertising courses"},{"text":"Academic foundation"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Reporting and dashboards"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"}],[{"text":"Digital Marketing certification"},{"text":"Broad foundation"}],[{"text":"Programmatic advertising training"},{"text":"Enterprise media buying"}],[{"text":"Google Tag/measurement learning"},{"text":"Conversion measurement"}],[{"text":"A/B testing / statistics"},{"text":"Experimentation"}],[{"text":"AI marketing training"},{"text":"AI-assisted advertising"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certification availability and pricing can change; verify current certification requirements and fees on the provider's official platform."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Media Buyer"},{"text":"Paid media + optimisation"},{"text":"Campaign portfolio"}],[{"text":"Paid Media Executive"},{"text":"Google/Meta + reporting"},{"text":"Platform projects"}],[{"text":"PPC Executive"},{"text":"Search advertising + keywords"},{"text":"Google Ads case"}],[{"text":"Paid Social Executive"},{"text":"Social ads + creative testing"},{"text":"Meta campaign case"}],[{"text":"Performance Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Paid media + analytics"},{"text":"Performance dashboard"}],[{"text":"Media Planning Executive"},{"text":"Media research + planning"},{"text":"Media plan"}],[{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive"},{"text":"SEO + SEM + social + analytics"},{"text":"Digital campaign"}],[{"text":"Growth Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Acquisition + experimentation"},{"text":"Growth case"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + analytics + BI"},{"text":"Dashboard"}],[{"text":"Campaign Analyst"},{"text":"Campaign data + reporting"},{"text":"Analytics project"}],[{"text":"Programmatic Executive"},{"text":"Programmatic + audience strategy"},{"text":"Programmatic learning"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Marketing Executive"},{"text":"Media + promotion + campaigns"},{"text":"Film/event project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate may not immediately manage very large advertising budgets independently."},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketing/Media Intern","Paid Media Executive/Junior Media Buyer","Media Buyer","Senior Media Buyer","Performance Marketing Manager","Media Director"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"Media, advertising and marketing leadership"}],[{"text":"MBA Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Digital/performance marketing"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data-driven marketing"}],[{"text":"MBA Media Management"},{"text":"Media and entertainment"}],[{"text":"MBA Advertising / Communication"},{"text":"Advertising strategy"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Advanced marketing analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Analytics"},{"text":"Analytics-heavy media roles"}],[{"text":"MA/MBA Media & Communication"},{"text":"Media industry"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Advertising / Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Industry specialisation"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Media Management"},{"text":"Media business"}],[{"text":"PhD in Marketing"},{"text":"Research and academia"}],[{"text":"PhD in Media / Communication"},{"text":"Media research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a student already holding a BBA, an immediate second general degree is usually unnecessary. A PG should provide a clear specialisation or career advantage."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystem","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Northwestern, NYU, USC, University of Texas, Michigan"},{"text":"University funding / Fulbright where eligible"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"LSE, Imperial, UCL, Warwick, Leeds"},{"text":"University scholarships / Chevening where eligible"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"University of Mannheim, TUM and relevant business schools"},{"text":"DAAD / university funding"},{"text":"Programme language and prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"UBC, Toronto, McGill, Western"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme and immigration requirements"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, Sydney"},{"text":"University scholarships / Australia Awards where eligible"},{"text":"Programme and visa requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Erasmus University Rotterdam, University of Amsterdam"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Competitive admission"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official scholarship resources include DAAD India and USIEF.","url":"https://www.daad.in/en/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Recommendation letters"},{"text":"English-language test where required"},{"text":"Portfolio/campaign cases"},{"text":"Internship certificates"},{"text":"Marketing projects"},{"text":"Financial documents"},{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Visa documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always check the exact programme rather than assuming a university has a dedicated “Media Buying” degree."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA – Event / Media / Film Business","Media / Digital Marketing Internship","Paid Media Executive / Junior Media Buyer","Media Buyer","Senior Media Buyer","Performance Marketing Manager / Media Planning Manager","Media Lead / Associate Media Director","Media Director / Performance Marketing Director","Head of Media / Growth / Marketing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative routes:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Media Buyer","Marketing Analytics","Marketing Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["Media Buyer","Growth Marketing","Growth Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["Media Buyer","Entertainment Marketing","Film/OTT Marketing Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Advertising effectiveness"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Digital advertising"},{"text":"Media economics"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"},{"text":"AI in advertising"},{"text":"Programmatic advertising"},{"text":"Digital consumer psychology"},{"text":"Social-media marketing"},{"text":"Entertainment marketing"},{"text":"Marketing technology"},{"text":"Brand communication"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"Long-term evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"A senior Media professional should eventually become responsible not just for buying media, but for how marketing investment produces measurable business growth."},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term profile should combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Media Strategy","Performance Marketing","Analytics","Consumer Behaviour","Creative Strategy","AI","Business Economics","Leadership"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential senior destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media Director"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Director"},{"text":"Head of Paid Media"},{"text":"Head of Growth"},{"text":"Head of Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Marketing Director"},{"text":"Chief Marketing Officer"},{"text":"Media/Marketing Consultant"},{"text":"Agency Founder"},{"text":"Independent Growth Consultant"}]}]}]}